{"animation":"idle","class":"Villager","hitbox":{"height":6,"width":10,"x":3,"y":10},"properties":[{"list":true,"name":"words","value":"Hello! Welcome to the village. The house up the path is yours, and the trees around it are older than any of us.\nThe hedge by the garden has grown wild again. Stand in front of a bush and press X (C on a keyboard) to cut it.\nYour things are saved whenever you come out of your house."},{"list":true,"name":"spots","type":"point"}],"solid":true,"sprite":"villager"}